    <item>
      <title>【已开通】求Cursor pro 首月半价邀请码</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2284879</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2284879</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 08:02:57 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;已经开通啦 感谢各位佬友&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/folded_hands.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:folded_hands:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:folded_hands:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
