      <guid>linux.do-topic-2282993</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 03:08:42 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-18495733-h-1&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-18495733-h-1&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;抽奖规则&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;回帖抽L站文化衫：大笑脸开户靠谱，夏天到了，来件L站的文化衫；或者其他热爱l站，想要l站文化衫的理由；或者任何a股券商问题咨询；都算参与；放心参与；&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/d/9/2/d923e714633ea1405f885779e89c316cf06ec45b.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/uYUwZFaRgRgJWkZQ9znBtB6c5Ob.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;8ce3e0fff7abf815cff9315551a4d75f&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/d/9/2/d923e714633ea1405f885779e89c316cf06ec45b.png&quot; alt=&quot;8ce3e0fff7abf815cff9315551a4d75f&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;uYUwZFaRgRgJWkZQ9znBtB6c5Ob&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;294&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F4EFEF&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;奖品：五件 **&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/u/shanwaiyoushan&quot;&gt;衫外有山&lt;/a&gt;**家的T恤【颜色可选:白色，黑色，粉色】&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/b/a/0ba570b76ca29dbcaaad57733b2a5f46bf351069.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/1F1HNkf65kF3nIGvnvIyxwaZglr.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;56db5e20d4e1649fc216db6ff1cba045&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/b/a/0ba570b76ca29dbcaaad57733b2a5f46bf351069_2_375x375.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;56db5e20d4e1649fc216db6ff1cba045&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;1F1HNkf65kF3nIGvnvIyxwaZglr&quot; width=&quot;375&quot; height=&quot;375&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/b/a/0ba570b76ca29dbcaaad57733b2a5f46bf351069_2_375x375.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/b/a/0ba570b76ca29dbcaaad57733b2a5f46bf351069_2_562x562.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/b/a/0ba570b76ca29dbcaaad57733b2a5f46bf351069_2_750x750.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;BFCFD8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;截止时间6.7号【官方抽奖工具】&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-18495733-h-15-2&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-18495733-h-15-2&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;大笑脸万1免5开户&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;【开户和推荐朋友都有红包】&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;佬友们好！大笑脸致力于帮助朋友们开到最便宜的券商，靠谱负责到底！ 你们自己去开券商，一般都是万3不免5，一年白白多花上万！找我开户都是最低的费率，股票一般都是万0.854免5或者万1免5，etf基金也是最低万0.5免5&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我们注重个人隐私，承诺个人信息仅用于开户，手机做脱敏处理；&lt;/p&gt;
